# What `vercel deploy` (remote build, ci.yml) must not upload. Vercel already skips .git,
# node_modules, .next and .vercel. Keep src, scripts, drizzle, e2e and tests: next build
# type-checks every file tsconfig.json includes.
.env*
!.env.example
*.pem
.claude/
.agents/
.github/
docs/
tasks/
test-results/
playwright-report/
e2e/.auth/
